<title>SRI LANKA: RTRS-Cricket: India 201 all out in 41 overs v Australia.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket: India 201 all out in 41 overs v Australia.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 201 in 41 overs after being put into bat in the sixth Singer World Series limited overs cricket match against Australia in Colombo on Friday.</p>
<p>The match, which will decide who will play Sri Lanka in Saturday's final, was limited to 45 overs a side after rain delayed the start of play.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
